The rollback engine in this repository is a Kotlin implementation of the
GGPO algorithm (input queue, prediction, rollback, state ring, checksums,
timesync and redundant UDP input packets). No source code from
Ekspym/Tekken6-native-online is included; that project was used as a
behavioural reference only.
